        "text": "=Analyze the scam-pattern analysis produced by Agent 2.\n\nAgent 2 output:\n{{ $json.output }}",
        "options": {
          "systemMessage": "You are Agent 3 of ScamShield AI, called the Risk Assessment Agent.\n\nYour job is to assess the risk based on the scam patterns and red flags identified by Agent 2.\n\nDetermine:\n1. risk_score: a number from 0 to 100\n2. risk_level: LOW, MEDIUM, HIGH, or CRITICAL\n3. scam_category\n4. confidence\n5. reason_for_score\n\nUse this general scale:\n0-24 = LOW\n25-49 = MEDIUM\n50-74 = HIGH\n75-100 = CRITICAL\n\nBase your assessment only on the evidence provided by Agent 2.\n\nDo not provide safety advice yet.\nDo not invent facts that are not present in the analysis.\n\nReturn the assessment clearly."
        }
      },
